  scoreValue: 100
  contactDamage: 1
  description: 'The rank and file of the endless host: a goblin, a sling, and a stone
    with your name whistling on it. Nobody remembers mustering them.'
  tactics: Falls straight down at a steady pace and fires a single green bolt straight
    ahead on a fixed cooldown. It never aims, so standing anywhere but directly beneath
    it is safe. Two hits end it - clear them early before bigger threats arrive,
    and never let a row of them fence you in.
